  "question": {
    "text": "<strong>Paragraph:</strong>\nTwo plane harmonic sound waves are expressed by the equations.\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n& y_1(x, t)=A \\cos (0.5 \\pi x-100 \\pi t) \\\\\n& y_2(x, t)=A \\cos (0.46 \\pi x-92 \\pi t)\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n(All parameters are in MKS)<strong>Question:</strong>\nWhat is the speed of the sound?",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "6uE6n",
      "text": "\n$200 \\mathrm{~m} / \\mathrm{s}$\n",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": true
    },
    {
      "id": "CHIv4",
      "text": "\n$180 \\mathrm{~m} / \\mathrm{s}$\n",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "jBiZr",
      "text": "\n$192 \\mathrm{~m} / \\mathrm{s}$\n",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "xKJ89",
      "text": "\n$96 \\mathrm{~m} / \\mathrm{s}$",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    }
  ],
  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "Speed of wave $v=\\frac{\\omega}{R}$ or $\\quad v=\\frac{100 \\pi}{0.5 \\pi}$ or $\\frac{92 \\pi}{0.46 \\pi}=200 \\mathrm{~m} / \\mathrm{s}$",
    "image": null
  },
